# Northstar task instructions (example; copy only into a chosen task checkout)

Use npm and Node 24. Read the task contract and context packet before editing.
Preserve session and organization membership checks, parameterized SQL and injectable clock.
Scope changes to task-list API, client and relevant tests. No schema or deployment changes.
Do not edit external verification/acceptance.ts or historical evidence.
Run typecheck, tests and build in the task checkout; record exact commands and results.
Return the diff summary, evidence paths, remaining uncertainty and checks not run.

This file is a teaching example. Its presence alone does not prove Codex loaded it. Copying instructions, choosing sandbox and inspecting inherited/user configuration are explicit steps in the optional guide.
